  - title: 02 / Watch the raw overcount
    explanation: Run RAW TEST. One press closes, opens, closes, opens, and closes
      again. Count the three upward steps. The test ends with a clean release and
      a short wait for the capacitor to discharge.
    caption: "RAW TEST  \u2022  THREE RISING EDGES"
    parts:
    - id: raw
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.5, y: 0.88}
      label: RAW
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.73, b: 0.31, a: 1}
    wires:
    - points:
      - {x: 0.1, y: 0.25}
      - {x: 0.92, y: 0.25}
      energized: 0
      color: {r: 0.38, g: 0.52, b: 0.6, a: 1}
