  - title: 03 / Reject a glitch and accept a press
    explanation: Select FILTERED MODE, then inject a 100 ms glitch. The filtered
      voltage stays under 3.0 V, so the count stays at zero. Run BOUNCED PRESS. The
      contact settles closed and the filtered voltage crosses 3.0 V once.
    caption: "FILTERED MODE  \u2022  3.0 V PRESS THRESHOLD"
    parts:
    - id: raw
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.34, y: 0.88}
      label: RAW
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.73, b: 0.31, a: 1}
    - id: filtered
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.66, y: 0.88}
      label: FILTERED
