  - title: 04 / Release and rearm
    explanation: Run BOUNCED RELEASE. The counter stays at one while FILTERED falls
      below 2.0 V and rearms. Run SECOND CYCLE. The filtered signal crosses 3.0 V
      once on the way up and 2.0 V once on the way down. The count finishes at two.
    caption: "2.0 V REARM THRESHOLD  \u2022  TWO COMPLETE CYCLES"
    parts:
    - id: raw
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.34, y: 0.88}
      label: RAW
